{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 2, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler a journey to Nippon I shall weave for thee a plan most grand.\n\n**Day the First Arrival in Edo's New Name**\n\nFrom skies afar thy vessel doth descend\nTo Narita's gate a new world to attend.\nA train awaits swift and strong and true\nTo Tokyo's heart a vibrant bustling view.\nHotel thou shalt find a place to rest\nPreparing for adventures truly blessed.\nShinjuku's lights a dazzling sight\nA feast for eyes throughout the night.\n\n**Day the Second Imperial Majesty and Ancient Grace**\n\nTo Imperial Palace we shall now proceed\nWhere emperors dwell fulfilling ancient creed.\nThe Ginza district a shopper's delight\nWith silks and treasures gleaming ever bright.\nSensoji Temple a sacred space\nIncense and prayers in this holy place.\nAsakusa's charm a bygone age\nTurning history's captivating page.\n\n**Day the Third Hakone's Beauty and Volcanic Might**\n\nHakone's mountains a scenic dream\nLake Ashi's waters a shimmering gleam.\nA cruise we'll take a tranquil ride\nWith views of Fuji's peak in glorious pride.\nVolcanic hot springs a soothing balm\nEasing weary limbs from every qualm.\nArt museums grand a cultured quest\nWhere beauty dwells and souls find rest.\n\n**Day the Fourth Kyoto's Temples and Gardens Fair**\n\nBy bullet train we swiftly fly\nTo Kyoto's realm beneath a tranquil sky.\nKiyomizu-dera Temple a wooden grace\nA panoramic vista time cannot erase.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vibrant hue\nThousands of torii a wondrous view.\nGion's district geishas softly tread\nMysteries whispered secrets gently said.\n\n**Day the Fifth Golden Pavilion and Zen's Embrace**\n\nKinkaku-ji's splendor a golden gleam\nReflecting beauty like a waking dream.\nRyoan-ji's garden a peaceful art\nZen's philosophy soothing to the heart.\nArashiyama Bamboo Grove so tall\nWhispering secrets answering nature's call.\nNijo Castle's grandeur a shogun's hold\nStories of power bravely told.\n\n**Day the Sixth Nara's Deer and Todai-ji's Might**\n\nTo Nara we journey with joyful pace\nWhere friendly deer roam with gentle grace.\nTodai-ji Temple a giant's might\nHousing Buddha's image bathed in light.\nKasuga Taisha Shrine lanterns glow\nA path to blessings softly flow.\nAncient traditions a sacred scene\nA tapestry woven serene.\n\n**Day the Seventh Osaka's Delights and Culinary Art**\n\nTo Osaka's streets we now do roam\nA city of flavors a culinary home.\nDotonbori's lights a vibrant show\nStreet food delights a joyful glow.\nOsaka Castle a fortress bold\nStories of warriors bravely told.\nShinsekai district a retro charm\nProtecting memories safe from harm.\n\n**Day the Eighth Departure from Nippon's Shore**\n\nAlas our journey nears its end\nMemories made a faithful friend.\nFrom Kansai Airport we take our flight\nBack to the world bathed in fading light.\nJapan's beauty forever we'll hold dear\nUntil we return to banish all fear.\nFarewell Nippon a land so grand\nA treasure cherished throughout the land.\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.011766082607209682}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -7.152555099310121e-07}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -1.4199776649475098}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.010183519683778286}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.230840802192688}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.5601962208747864}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.030717788264155388}, {"token": "▁Nippon", "logprob": -0.5151702761650085}, {"token": "▁I", "logprob": -1.2565566301345825}, {"token": "▁shall", "logprob": -0.0049257357604801655}, {"token": "▁weave", "logprob": -0.15091931819915771}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.09626992046833038}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -6.198863957251888e-06}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.13564644753932953}, {"token": "▁plan", "logprob": -1.081830382347107}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.0673043504357338}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.049094341695308685}, {"token": ".", "